---
title: "borrow (Pebble Protocol: Lending Entry Points)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_validate_market: validate_market(market)
    q_validate_market --> q_circuit_break: check circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_error_cb: circuit_break triggered
    q_error_cb --> [*]: abort market_under_circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_timestamp: now = clock.timestamp_ms() / 1000
    q_timestamp --> q_handle_borrow: handle_borrow(obligation_id, amount, registry, oracle, clock, now)
    q_handle_borrow --> q_update_reward: update_obligation_reward_manager(borrow_reward_type)
    q_update_reward --> q_emit: emit BorrowEvent
    q_emit --> q_return: coin::from_balance(borrowed_balance, ctx)
    q_return --> [*]: return Coin

    note right of q_handle_borrow
        INV-001: borrow_amount must be non-zero
        INV-002: borrow must not be paused for this asset
        INV-003: obligation must belong to this market
        INV-004: borrow rate limiter outflow is added
        INV-005: cannot borrow an asset used as collateral in same obligation
        INV-006: obligation must remain safe (weighted_debt <= weighted_collateral)
        INV-007: total borrow must not exceed asset max_borrow_amount
        INV-008: emode group borrow limit must not be exceeded
        INV-009: debt must be >= min_borrow_amount after operation
    end note
